    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mi>x</mi> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />And maximum value of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
